{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChQZwTt9XZvPoT6cJqAEw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Got it. Two decisions are settled and two are still open.\n\n**Settled**\n- The discount is a percentage of the subtotal.\n- It's applied before VAT: VAT is 20% of the discounted subtotal.\n- Everything from the previous round still stands.\n\n**My calls** (tell me if you disagree)\n- The field is `order.discount = { percent: n }`, where n is between 0 and 100. Decimals like 12.5 are allowed. Anything outside that range is rejected. If the field is missing, the discount is 0%.\n- The discount amount is rounded to the nearest cent with `Math.round`, the same rule the VAT already uses.\n\n**Still open**\n\n3. **How does a discount affect a line refund?** With a percentage discount, every line is reduced by the same proportion, so the earlier \"spread across lines\" option becomes simpler.\n   - (a) A refunded unit returns its price minus the discount percentage, plus VAT on that. I'd handle leftover cents from rounding so that refunding every line comes to exactly what was charged.\n   - (b) Ignore the discount and refund the full line price. This pays back more than the customer paid.\n   - (c) Refuse line refunds on discounted orders. Only whole-order refunds are allowed.\n   \n   **I recommend (a).**\n\n4. **How should the discount show on the invoice?**\n   - (a) As its own line: subtotal → discount (n%) → net → VAT → total, with the original line prices unchanged\n   - (b) Folded into the lines: each line's price is reduced, and no discount line appears\n   \n   **I recommend (a).** It keeps the reconciliation rule easy to check: subtotal − discount + tax = total. It also means the discount is rounded once for the whole order instead of once per line.\n\nOnce you've answered these two, I'll build it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1475,"cache_read_input_tokens":38519,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1475},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"10c61d5b-e526-48f8-bde1-7570841759f1","uuid":"682cc712-1041-43f3-94b7-add3b7cf84aa","timestamp":"2026-11-26T00:10:08.673Z","request_id":"req_011ChQZwTjirJxBfwQcJtKtY"}
